OL,3,AMove to stop charges for parents to sit
OL,4,Aby children on flights
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government says it will ensure
OL,7,Fparents cannot be charged for sitting
OL,8,Fnext to their children on planes if new
OL,9,Fpowers get approval in Parliament.
OL,11,FUK airlines said they adhered to
OL,12,Fexisting rules.
OL,14,FIf the Civil Aviation Bill gets
OL,15,Fapproved by MPs, the Department for
OL,16,FTransport says it will consult on
OL,17,Fscrapping any charges for being seated
OL,18,Fnext to children under the age of 14 or
OL,19,Fcorrecting minor errors on flight
OL,20,Fbookings.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,0,100
